    "plain_text": "Isabel dos Santos is an Angolan investor whose holdings spanned telecommunications, banking, media and retail in Angola and Portugal. The daughter of former president José Eduardo dos Santos, she built a portfolio through corporate stakes and board roles. Investigations and court actions later challenged the origins and control of significant parts of that business empire.",
